<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kimberly-Clark upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kimberly-Clark upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Tuesday it raised its rating on the shares of Kimberly-Clark Corp to outperform from neutral.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 1-9/16 to 48-13/16 in active trade.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
